<diagram program="umletino" version="15.1"><zoom_level>10</zoom_level><help_text>start

Site Engineer: Create Request
Classify by UNSPSC + Subtype

Gate: Request Intent?
    [Missing Intent Essentials]
        Ask only Intent Essentials
        (Commercial + Minimal Technical)
    [Complete]
        Item State = INTENT

AI Technical Completion
    Retrieve Similar Items + Past Catalog
    Resolve OEM / Model / MPN Candidates
    Extract Specs from Datasheets / Quotes
    Apply Conditional Rules
        (e.g., Bolt-on -&gt; holes_count)

Confidence High?
    [Yes]
        Auto-fill Specs
        Mark provenance: AI / Datasheet
    [No]
        Request Clarifications
        Only Missing Procurement Keys

Gate: Procurement Ready?
    [Missing Required / Conditional]
        Block RFQ / PO
        Show Missing List + Reason
        stop
    [Complete]
        Procurement: RFQ / PO
        Select Approved OEM / Model

Project Brand / AVL Constraints?
    [Violates]
        Reject Candidate
        Suggest Approved Equivalents
        stop
    [OK]
        PO Issued

Gate: Delivery / Receiving?
    [Missing Certificates / QA]
        Hold GRN / Inspection
        stop
    [Complete]
        Accept &amp; Close Loop

Learning Loop
    Log Accept / Edit / Reject with evidence
    Periodic Training + Rule Updates

stop
</help_text><element><id>UMLUseCase</id><coordinates><x>50</x><y>290</y><w>120</w><h>40</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>Use case 2
